5 Terraform Commands That Prevent Production Mistakes

1️⃣ terraform fmt
Standardize formatting → Improve readability → Reduce noisy PRs

2️⃣ terraform validate
Catch syntax & configuration issues before touching infrastructure

3️⃣ terraform plan
Preview every infrastructure change before execution

4️⃣ terraform state list
Verify what's actually managed by Terraform—not what you think is managed

5️⃣ terraform output
Expose infrastructure details without hardcoding values
